<Defs>
  <!--=========================== Plants ==============================-->
  <ThingDef Name="Plant_Bloddle" ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>Plant_Bloddle</defName>
    <label>bloddle plant</label>
    <description>Bloddle was a tasty bulb vegetable grown in the hydroponic gardens and was a popular crop on Tatooine (although it could be found on several worlds). It could be used to enhance the flavor of other foods and was commonly grown for such purposes.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>85</MaxHitPoints>
      <Nutrition>0.2</Nutrition>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>swplants/Bloddle</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Random</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <selectable>true</selectable>
    <pathCost>14</pathCost>
    <ingestible />
    <plant>
      <fertilitySensitivity>0.4</fertilitySensitivity>
      <immatureGraphicPath>swplants/Bloddle_Immature</immatureGraphicPath>
      <dieIfLeafless>true</dieIfLeafless>
      <maxMeshCount>16</maxMeshCount>
      <harvestTag>Standard</harvestTag>
      <harvestedThingDef>RawBloddle</harvestedThingDef>
      <harvestYield>5</harvestYield>
      <sowTags>
        <li>Ground</li>
        <li>Hydroponic</li>
      </sowTags>
      <topWindExposure>0.1</topWindExposure>
      <growDays>4</growDays>
      <visualSizeRange>0.3~0.6</visualSizeRange>
      <wildOrder>2</wildOrder>
      <purpose>Food</purpose>
      <humanFoodPlant>true</humanFoodPlant>
    </plant>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef Name="Plant_Bubblespore" ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>Plant_Bubblespore</defName>
    <label>bubble spore plant</label>
    <description>Bubble spore was a species of fast-growing plant that were native to the swamps of Naboo. Santhe Industries and TaggeCo were interested in studying the peculiar properties of the bubble spore, testing several strains of them off-world with limited success. This variant found agricultural success as an alternative starter in alcohol production or as anmimal feed.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>85</MaxHitPoints>
      <Nutrition>0.2</Nutrition>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>swplants/BubbleSpore</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Random</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <selectable>true</selectable>
    <pathCost>14</pathCost>
    <ingestible />
    <plant>
      <fertilitySensitivity>0.7</fertilitySensitivity>
      <immatureGraphicPath>swplants/BubbleSpore_Immature</immatureGraphicPath>
      <dieIfLeafless>true</dieIfLeafless>
      <maxMeshCount>4</maxMeshCount>
      <harvestTag>Standard</harvestTag>
      <harvestedThingDef>RawBubblespore</harvestedThingDef>
      <drugForHarvestPurposes>True</drugForHarvestPurposes>
      <harvestYield>16</harvestYield>
      <sowTags>
        <li>Ground</li>
        <li>Hydroponic</li>
      </sowTags>
      <topWindExposure>0.1</topWindExposure>
      <growDays>3</growDays>
      <visualSizeRange>0.3~1.0</visualSizeRange>
      <wildOrder>2</wildOrder>
    </plant>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef Name="Plant_Chakroot" ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>Plant_Chakroot</defName>
    <label>chak-root plant</label>
    <description>Chak-root was a flavorful red root plant that grew in the marshlands of the planet Erysthes, but was also be found on Naboo (amongst others where it was exported). The sale of this plant carried high taxes, so it was a favorite of smugglers who often developed a taste for it themselves.</description>
