    <label>manax fungus</label>
    <description>Manax fungus is native to the planet Neimoidia and the surrounding "purse worlds" (such as Deko Neimoidia), usually Manax trees are grown and mulched down to feed this photosynthetic fungus. This variant has been selected to grow without such a requirement (albeit at the cost of significantly reduced yield).</description>
