  <ThingDef Name="Plant_MunchFungus" ParentName="CavePlantBase">
    <defName>Plant_MunchFungus</defName>
    <label>munch-fungus</label>
    <description>Munch-fungus was a species of edible cave mushroom that grew in abundance on the planet Ryloth. One of several fungal strains that contributed to the traditional diet of the indigenous Twi'leks, munch-fungus was a versatile food that could be cooked in a variety of culinary dishes. Possessed of a naturally spongy consistency and bland flavor, munch-fungus could nevertheless be prepared and seasoned to suit a multitude of tastes. It could also be worked into a tasty munch-fungus bread especially by an experienced cook.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>85</MaxHitPoints>
      <Nutrition>0.25</Nutrition>
