    <label>tooke-trap plant</label>
    <description>Tooke-trap plants were a species of carnivorous plant that were native to the swamps of Naboo. This strain was selected for it's beauty but there were rumours of larger more aggressive variants that could eat small animals like the Tooke (for which the plant got it's name).</description>
